{
  "_comment": [
    "The MCP tool configurator, described as data rather than code.",
    "",
    "The source built this surface in mcp_modal.js: 1,347 lines of jQuery that",
    "hard-coded every field, every option list, every conditional and every",
    "validation rule three times over — once per tool kind. Adding a field to",
    "the HTTP tool meant editing the render function, the change handler, the",
    "defaults and the validator.",
    "",
    "Here the same surface is a schema. The UI renders whatever this file",
    "declares, so adding a field is one entry below and no frontend change.",
    "",
    "Field shape is the node registry's FormField: key, label, type, required,",
    "placeholder, options, rows, min, max. Two additions:",
    "  showWhen  {path, in|notIn: [...]}  render only when the draft matches",
    "  unique    true                     value must be unique across tools",
    "Validation is derived: a visible required field that is empty is an error,",
    "so the rules cannot drift from the form the way the source's did."
  ],

  "server": {
    "title": "MCP Server Configuration",
    "fields": [
      { "key": "displayName", "label": "Tool Display Name", "type": "text" },
      { "key": "description", "label": "Description", "type": "textarea", "rows": 2 },
      {
        "key": "serverName",
        "label": "Server Name",
        "type": "text",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "e.g. tripleq-energy-mcp"
      },
      {
        "key": "transportType",
        "label": "Transport Type",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          { "value": "streamable_http", "label": "streamable_http" },
          { "value": "sse", "label": "sse" },
          { "value": "stdio", "label": "stdio" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "url",
        "label": "Server URL",
        "type": "text",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "http://localhost:8001/mcp",
        "showWhen": { "path": "transportType", "in": ["streamable_http", "sse"] }
      },
      {
        "key": "headers",
        "label": "Headers",
        "type": "key_value_object",
        "showWhen": { "path": "transportType", "in": ["streamable_http", "sse"] }
      },
      {
        "key": "command",
        "label": "Command",
        "type": "text",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "python",
        "showWhen": { "path": "transportType", "in": ["stdio"] }
      },
      {
        "key": "args",
        "label": "Arguments",
        "type": "string_list",
        "placeholder": "e.g. -m tripleq_energy_mcp",
        "showWhen": { "path": "transportType", "in": ["stdio"] }
      },
      {
        "key": "env",
        "label": "Environment Variables",
        "type": "key_value_object",
        "showWhen": { "path": "transportType", "in": ["stdio"] }
      }
    ]
  },

  "serverDefaults": {
    "displayName": "",
    "description": "",
    "serverName": "",
    "transportType": "streamable_http",
    "url": "",
    "headers": {},
    "command": "",
    "args": [],
    "env": {},
    "configuredTools": []
  },

  "toolNameRule": {
    "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
    "message": "Tool Name must be lowercase snake_case."
  },

  "toolKinds": [
    {
